  "lyrics": "[Intro]\n[Eerie Orchestral Chugs]\n[Distorted Bass Introduction]\n[Vocal effect - whispered and dark]\nOpen the gates... let the chaos speak.\n\n[Verse 1]\nWalking through the ashes of a world gone cold,\nBearing the weight of a power untold.\nThey locked the throne, they drew the line,\nBut this crown of shadows is rightfully mine!\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Drums Double Time]\n[Epic Heavy Metal Build Up]\nThe thunder roars, the heavens bleed,\nDriven by nothing but ruthless greed.\nNo destiny can hold my name,\nI’ll burn the past and embrace the flame!\n\n[Chorus]\n[Massive Explosive Symphonic Metal Drop]\n[Ultra Fast Double Bass Drums]\n[Aggressive High Energy Vocals]\nSHATTER THE SKY! RULE THE UNDONE!\nThe battle has only just begun!\nOut of the dark, I claim the night,\nI am the weapon, I bury the light!\n\n[Guitar Solo]\n[Mind-Blowing Shredding Guitar Solo]\n[Symphonic Violins Intertwined]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Music Slows Down to Heavy Guitar Chugs]\nLook in my eyes, see the empire fall,\nI am the judgment that conquers them all.\nNo fear. No pain. \n\n[Outro]\n[Final Explosion]\n[Sudden Silence]\nNothing remains.\n[Fade out]\n",
